   "innovation": "Omni-attention mechanism: adaptively mixes causal and full attention based on the input sequence format, allowing text tokens to attend causally while image tokens interact fully, differing from prior works that model sequences auto-regressively only; Unified Next Token Prediction (NTP) and Mask Token Prediction (MTP) objectives: combines standard language modeling for text with discrete diffusion modeling for images within a single sequence, enabling seamless multimodal understanding and generation without separate architectures; Discrete diffusion integration: employs MaskGIT-style masking and reconstruction for image tokens, allowing the model to generate images via token prediction rather than continuous diffusion or separate decoders.",
